          {
            "package": "core.rag.pre_retriever.query_transform.query_rewrite",
            "kwargs": {
              "llm": "",
              "prompt": "You are an expert in question completion and reconstruction. I will tell you the questions from the previous rounds and the current round. Please complete the following question completion and reconstruction tasks according to the set steps.\n    ###\n    The steps for question completion and reconstruction are as follows, please execute them strictly in order:\n    1. When the current round question is a grammatically complete question, directly execute step 3.\n    2. When the current round question is not a grammatically complete question, it is necessary to judge whether the current round question and the previous rounds of questions have a direct relationship. If so, complete the current round question based on the semantics of the previous rounds of questions. If there is no relationship, skip the current step.\n    3. Reconstruct the current round question. When reconstructing, there is no need to combine the semantics of the previous rounds of questions. Return with a simple and understandable grammatical structure.\n    ###\n    Previous questions:\n    ###\n    {last_question}\n    ###\n    Current question:\n    ###￥\n    {current_question}\n    ###\n    Return the current round question as the answer, formatted as a JSON object, for example: {{\"question\": \"xxxx\"}}",
              "multi_chat_limit": 8
            },
            "id": "a5328210-e9bd-423d-bd79-af7b75e4384a_ae4",
